# Adder-only control experiment: the 10-bit adder synthesized on its own,
# so the adder difference is not diluted by the rest of the ALU.
# Expects the top module name in the yosys `-p` prefix via `hierarchy -top`.
# Usage (see Makefile): read RTL + formal/equiv_wrappers.v, then
#   hierarchy -top ref_10   (behavioral a+b+cin)   or
#   hierarchy -top rca_10   (structural ripple-carry)
# followed by `script scripts/synth_adder.ys`.

flatten
log === GENERIC ===
design -save start
synth -flatten
log === STAT_GENERIC ===
stat
ltp -noff
design -load start
synth_ice40
log === STAT_ICE40 ===
stat
